      "@type": "Intent",
      "label": "An extensible DREGG-native programmable nexus",
      "description": "The desired offering is a DREGG-native programmable nexus that grows to encompass the suite, explicitly including Clutch. Ember accepts a mix of activities centered on kernel/shell programmability; a single first application need not be selected.",
      "subject": "urn:dregg:assortia:E-WORLD",
      "sources": [
        "urn:dregg:assortia:S-CONVERSATION"
      ]
    },
    {
