      "label": "Unconfirmed settlement reservation replays through a success-shaped receipt",
      "description": "Durable settlement replays an unconfirmed reservation without dispatch; the record omits payer/beneficiary identities, conflict compares amount/asset, and the returned receipt lacks an uncertain/completed outcome.",
