      "@type": "Claim",
      "label": "General multi-cell machinery exists beyond ordinary native invocation",
      "description": "MultiCellHyperedge prepares and admits all exact incidences; resource birth uses multi-cell composition. Ordinary declared invocation hardcodes target plus authority. A general user-authored joint-operation receiver remains work.",
