      "label": "Mini native recovery preserves exact ingress but scales with full history",
      "description": "Each ordinary host request reopens and semantically re-admits original signed ingress; native storage replaces one bounded whole-image BLOB. Exact retries retain original-prefix receipt identity. Incremental persistence must preserve those semantics.",
